WEBVTT

00:24.430 --> 00:25.750
Wow!

00:26.930 --> 00:28.870
So many people and carriages!

00:34.350 --> 00:37.240
Let's see... The Royal Academy is...

00:40.000 --> 00:42.020
Excuse me. Are you all right?

00:43.220 --> 00:46.210
I suddenly started feeling ill...

00:46.210 --> 00:46.960
Huh?!

00:56.780 --> 01:00.160
Thank you. I feel better now.

01:00.860 --> 01:03.620
I'm glad. You'll be all right now.

01:03.620 --> 01:07.720
Thank you so much. How can I ever repay you?

01:07.720 --> 01:08.920
You don't need to thank me.

01:09.430 --> 01:12.420
It took a long time since I'm only level 1.

01:12.720 --> 01:16.580
Oh, no. Who knows what would have 
happened to my mother if not for you?

01:17.240 --> 01:19.300
Wait, by any chance...

01:20.130 --> 01:22.950
Were you on your way to the Royal Academy?

01:22.950 --> 01:25.560
Yes, I'm moving into the dorm today.

01:25.790 --> 01:28.050
Oh, then you'd better hurry!

01:28.050 --> 01:28.770
Huh?

01:28.770 --> 01:32.070
I believe the academy's 
gates close at 6 o'clock.

01:32.070 --> 01:33.290
What?!

01:45.080 --> 01:47.850
Wait! Wait!

01:52.220 --> 01:53.460
You're kidding...

01:54.320 --> 01:55.900
It's time to lock the gate.

01:56.250 --> 02:00.470
It's the rule that the Royal 
Academy's main gate closes at 6 o'clock.

02:00.470 --> 02:04.170
But the bell hasn't even finished ringing...

02:05.710 --> 02:07.050
And now it has.

02:07.610 --> 02:09.250
Your name and grade?

02:09.890 --> 02:13.240
Alicia Ehnleit. I'm a new first-year.

02:13.240 --> 02:16.380
Wait, the color of your necktie... 
Aren't you a first-year, too?

02:16.380 --> 02:19.110
Yes. I've been helping with the weekly duties

02:19.110 --> 02:21.870
to get myself accustomed to the school.

02:22.170 --> 02:25.190
In any case, the rules are absolute.

02:25.630 --> 02:27.750
You'll have to find lodging 
in town for tonight.

02:27.960 --> 02:30.640
But the entrance ceremony is tomorrow.

02:30.970 --> 02:33.880
I need to get into the dorm today.

02:34.140 --> 02:39.380
Besides, um... I don't have that much money.

02:39.380 --> 02:44.830
Oh, so you're the one commoner 
who was admitted here this year.

02:45.200 --> 02:47.060
Not that I don't sympathize...

02:48.760 --> 02:52.150
But rules are rules. Just give up.

02:52.150 --> 02:54.980
What?! But you're a first-year, too!

02:54.980 --> 02:56.590
Meanie!

02:56.590 --> 03:00.770
Now, what I'm about to say 
is just me talking to myself.

03:00.770 --> 03:01.450
Huh?

03:01.450 --> 03:04.750
There's a part of the wall on the 
eastern side that's crumbling.

03:04.750 --> 03:08.770
Students who break curfew often 
enter and leave through there.

03:08.770 --> 03:11.370
You're unlikely to be seen at this hour.

03:13.750 --> 03:15.170
What's your name?

03:15.170 --> 03:18.990
Oh, I hadn't introduced 
myself yet. How rude of me.

03:18.990 --> 03:20.930
I'm Oswald Grimsarde.

03:20.930 --> 03:24.740
Grimsarde? I've heard that 
name somewhere before...

03:24.740 --> 03:27.800
Probably my father. He's a 
cabinet minister, after all.

03:27.800 --> 03:29.680
You're the son of a minister?!

03:29.680 --> 03:34.210
My father is my father, and I am 
me. Please call me by my name.

03:34.210 --> 03:37.460
Sure. I'll call you Oz, then.

03:37.460 --> 03:38.840
O-Oz?

03:42.980 --> 03:46.560
Thanks, Oz! You're a nice guy!

03:47.330 --> 03:48.710
I hope we'll be friends!

04:02.380 --> 04:03.160
Hand.

04:03.160 --> 04:04.090
Huh?

04:04.090 --> 04:06.230
You broke curfew too, right?

04:06.230 --> 04:08.300
I'll help you in. Give me your hand.

04:08.300 --> 04:08.970
C'mon.

04:10.040 --> 04:11.140
Thanks.

04:12.170 --> 04:14.460
Here we go. Ready, and... up!

04:15.350 --> 04:17.130
You're really strong!

04:20.040 --> 04:21.500
Just follow me.

04:22.710 --> 04:25.200
I'm William Ares. You?

04:25.200 --> 04:28.490
Alicia Ehnleit. Are you 
a new first-year, too?

04:28.700 --> 04:33.460
Yeah. The older guys in the dorm 
sent me to buy drinks for a party.

04:33.780 --> 04:34.490
See?

04:35.620 --> 04:36.650
Oh...

04:37.710 --> 04:42.320
It's sort of a ritual for 
new kids entering the dorm.

04:42.320 --> 04:43.190
Whoops...

04:43.570 --> 04:45.000
Watch your step there.

04:49.300 --> 04:52.390
Thanks. You really are strong, huh?

04:54.030 --> 04:55.770
My dad's a general.

04:55.770 --> 04:58.220
He's been training me since I was a kid.

04:59.270 --> 05:01.450
A minister and a general...

05:01.900 --> 05:04.610
All the people here are from 
such impressive families.

05:04.610 --> 05:07.320
Don't space out. If you're 
not paying attention—

05:09.590 --> 05:12.620
I-I... I can't!

05:14.960 --> 05:16.070
What the?!

05:16.070 --> 05:17.420
They just fell through the roof!

05:17.420 --> 05:18.580
You okay?!

05:19.320 --> 05:22.090
That... didn't hurt? What?

05:22.090 --> 05:24.430
I'm the one who's hurting.

05:24.430 --> 05:26.410
Would you mind getting off of me?

05:26.930 --> 05:29.600
I'm so sorry! Are you all right?

05:31.230 --> 05:32.100
Who are you?

05:32.980 --> 05:34.790
My name is Alicia.

05:34.790 --> 05:38.100
Hey, Ed. That had to hurt.

05:38.100 --> 05:40.010
Ed? Are you two friends?

05:40.810 --> 05:44.240
Yeah. I've known Will since we were kids.

05:46.230 --> 05:48.400
I'm Edwin Valschein,

05:48.400 --> 05:51.240
the second prince of the 
Kingdom of Valschein.

05:51.240 --> 05:52.930
A prince?!

05:54.100 --> 05:59.080
<b>Light Magic and the Hero</b>

05:58.750 --> 06:06.010
<b>Light Magic and the Hero</b>

06:06.570 --> 06:10.910
The only commoner
 at the academy 
Alicia 
CV: Azumi Waki

06:14.520 --> 06:16.900
Second prince of the
 Kingdom of Valschein 
Edwin 
CV: Taku Yashiro

06:17.210 --> 06:22.040
A swordsman with a 
strong sense of justice 
William 
CV: Haruki Ishiya

06:22.190 --> 06:26.320
An elite magic user 
of high-ranking nobility 
Oswald 
CV: Kohei Amasaki

06:29.790 --> 06:32.080
The strongest, most 
passionate knight captain in the kingdom 
Adolf 
CV: Shinji Kawada

06:32.080 --> 06:34.500
The apex of female
 students and a tyrant 
Eleonora 
CV: Rina Hidaka

06:34.500 --> 06:37.100
A girl attending the academy 
Jessica 
CV: Konomi Inagaki

06:46.840 --> 06:49.430
A boy attending the academy 
Patrick 
CV: Yuma Uchida

06:49.430 --> 06:52.700
The black-haired villainess 
Yumiella 
CV: Fairouz Ai

07:16.720 --> 07:23.940
<b>Light Magic and the Hero</b>

07:25.210 --> 07:27.460
We haven't even had the 
entrance ceremony yet,

07:27.460 --> 07:31.430
and you're already causing a commotion. 
You don't waste time, do you?

07:31.430 --> 07:35.390
As the principal, I feel that 
makes you worth teaching.

07:35.390 --> 07:37.050
This is all your fault.

07:37.050 --> 07:38.470
What? Why me?

07:38.470 --> 07:40.870
I got distracted 'cause you talked to me.

07:40.870 --> 07:41.790
Excuse me?!

07:41.790 --> 07:43.190
Quiet.

07:44.810 --> 07:46.600
William Ares...

07:46.970 --> 07:49.570
I'll be confiscating this.

07:52.750 --> 07:54.920
And Alicia Ehnleit...

07:54.920 --> 07:56.070
Y-Yes?

07:56.070 --> 08:00.080
You have a rare and precious 
talent for light magic.

08:00.400 --> 08:05.870
That is why you were the one and only 
commoner admitted here on a scholarship.

08:05.870 --> 08:10.090
Always be aware of that, and mind 
your behavior going forward.

08:10.090 --> 08:11.610
I'm sorry.

08:11.610 --> 08:14.090
You will both be given extra duties 
for one week as punishment.

08:14.090 --> 08:17.000
You are to work together, and no fighting.

08:17.000 --> 08:18.330
You may go.

08:18.760 --> 08:20.730
Pardon us.

08:27.000 --> 08:30.480
<i>I see. So that's Alicia Ehnleit.</i>

08:32.870 --> 08:38.870
<i>She's our kingdom's last hope 
of salvation from the Demon Lord...</i>

08:45.180 --> 08:47.760
I screwed up on my first day.

08:47.760 --> 08:51.690
I showed up late, broke a window, and 
even got punished with extra duties.

08:52.190 --> 08:53.200
Intruder!

08:53.720 --> 08:55.550
There's an intruder! Capture him!

08:55.880 --> 08:57.160
Where'd he go?

08:57.160 --> 09:00.180
He may have climbed the wall to get outside.

09:00.180 --> 09:02.460
Go and look. I'll check the dorm.

09:02.460 --> 09:03.310
Right!

09:04.570 --> 09:06.710
There's been an intruder on school grounds!

09:06.710 --> 09:08.440
All of you, stay inside!

09:08.440 --> 09:09.430
Okay!

09:09.430 --> 09:10.800
Got it!

09:12.440 --> 09:14.070
Scary...

09:14.070 --> 09:17.890
I guess bad guys target this 
school since it's full of nobles?

09:18.510 --> 09:21.950
But I'm safe on that front, 
considering I'm a commoner.

09:32.470 --> 09:33.850
Take that!

09:34.800 --> 09:36.840
Someone—

09:36.840 --> 09:39.020
Be quiet. I'm not a bad guy.

09:39.850 --> 09:40.790
It's you!

09:41.410 --> 09:43.530
Your name was... Alicia?

09:44.570 --> 09:48.100
It's me. Remember, the 
guy who broke your fall?

09:48.330 --> 09:50.460
Edwin... Your Highness?!

09:51.170 --> 09:53.770
Yeah, there's some stuff going on...

09:53.770 --> 09:55.240
"Stuff"?

09:55.240 --> 09:57.730
There's something I want to look into...

09:58.330 --> 10:01.250
But when I tried to sneak into the 
school building, they spotted me.

10:01.570 --> 10:03.290
I can't tell you the details, but...

10:03.290 --> 10:04.350
Find him?

10:04.350 --> 10:05.870
I didn't see him anywhere.

10:06.250 --> 10:09.140
I see. Stay on guard, though.

10:09.140 --> 10:10.130
Got it.

10:12.500 --> 10:14.600
I can't go out there yet.

10:14.600 --> 10:17.260
Please, let me hide here for a while.

10:17.260 --> 10:18.340
What?!

10:24.890 --> 10:26.480
Sorry about this.

10:26.480 --> 10:31.660
I know a gentleman shouldn't just 
dive into a lady's room, but...

10:31.660 --> 10:34.780
Oh, it's fine. This almost 
feels like a dream.

10:35.080 --> 10:39.020
I've never talked to a member 
of the royal family before.

10:39.020 --> 10:43.460
It's the same for me. I'm always 
surrounded by royalty and nobles.

10:43.910 --> 10:47.370
Are all commoner women as violent as you?

10:48.540 --> 10:51.670
Don't be mean! I did that because 
I thought you were a robber!

10:52.000 --> 10:55.420
I'm just kidding. Please don't hit me again.

11:00.370 --> 11:02.680
I suppose I owe you one now.

11:02.960 --> 11:04.970
About what happened tonight...

11:04.970 --> 11:07.560
Don't worry. I won't tell anyone.

11:07.560 --> 11:08.800
I appreciate it.

11:10.780 --> 11:12.740
I think the coast is clear now.

11:12.740 --> 11:14.970
I don't want to trouble 
you by staying too long.

11:18.130 --> 11:21.200
See you at the entrance ceremony 
tomorrow. Goodnight, Alicia.

11:21.830 --> 11:24.440
Be careful, Prince Edwin.

11:31.780 --> 11:33.730
The new students will now enter.

11:53.530 --> 11:54.940
Oh, I'm sorry...

12:04.680 --> 12:08.010
Is something the matter, Alicia Ehnleit?

12:08.910 --> 12:11.480
H-How do you know my name?

12:11.480 --> 12:13.250
I... just do.

12:13.250 --> 12:16.170
More importantly, are you feeling ill?

12:16.170 --> 12:17.900
I-I'm all right.

12:20.810 --> 12:24.510
The Royal Academy Entrance 
Ceremony will now commence.

12:25.150 --> 12:29.510
Having the privilege to welcome you 
first-years to our school today

12:29.510 --> 12:32.760
gives all of us at the academy 
the greatest pleasure.

12:32.760 --> 12:34.520
As you are already aware...

12:34.940 --> 12:37.020
That's enough, Yumiella!

12:37.780 --> 12:40.820
That devil's luck of yours 
is finally about to run out!

13:01.590 --> 13:03.330
Now, Alicia!

13:03.330 --> 13:03.840
Right!

13:04.570 --> 13:06.490
Sacred light magic,

13:06.490 --> 13:09.850
banish the darkness and grant me strength!

13:27.690 --> 13:28.740
Alicia...

13:29.430 --> 13:33.640
Edwin

13:29.430 --> 13:33.640
Well done, Alicia.

13:33.640 --> 13:38.250
Alicia

13:33.640 --> 13:38.250
Thank you, Prince Edwin.

13:45.300 --> 13:47.180
It's morning...

13:48.540 --> 13:52.330
<i>This game is called </i>Light Magic and the Hero<i>,</i>

13:48.990 --> 13:50.600
<b>Light Magic and the Hero</b>

13:50.600 --> 13:55.180
<b>Light Magic and the Hero</b>

13:52.630 --> 13:55.190
<i>or </i>Light and Hero<i> for short.</i>

13:52.700 --> 13:55.190
<b>Light and Hero</b>

13:55.450 --> 13:57.530
<i>It takes place in a world 
of swords and magic.</i>

13:56.210 --> 13:59.690
Oswald

13:56.210 --> 13:59.690
Not that I don't sympathize... 
But rules are rules. Just give up.

13:57.940 --> 14:00.620
<i>The heroine enrolls in the Royal Academy,</i>

14:00.620 --> 14:03.830
<i>where she deepens her relationships 
with the conquerable characters</i>

14:00.710 --> 14:04.200
William

14:00.710 --> 14:04.200
You broke curfew too, right? 
I'll help you in. Give me your hand. C'mon.

14:03.830 --> 14:06.850
<i>as she levels up and, eventually, 
defeats the Demon Lord.</i>

14:05.210 --> 14:08.700
Edwin

14:05.210 --> 14:08.700
I suppose I owe you one now. 
About what happened tonight...

14:06.850 --> 14:08.700
<i>It's a fairly cliché story.</i>

14:08.700 --> 14:11.770
<i>But after the ending in which 
the Demon Lord is defeated,</i>

14:09.470 --> 14:11.720
The Demon Lord is defeated, but...

14:11.720 --> 14:14.200
A hidden boss has appeared.

14:11.770 --> 14:14.200
<i>the hidden boss, the game's 
strongest foe, appears.</i>

14:15.380 --> 14:17.970
<i>She is Yumiella Dolkness,</i>

14:17.970 --> 14:24.480
Yumiella...?!

14:18.280 --> 14:19.780
<i>the villainess who uses dark magic</i>

14:19.480 --> 14:24.480
Don't tell me you're...

14:19.780 --> 14:23.270
<i>and bullies the heroine, 
Alicia, throughout the game.</i>

14:20.980 --> 14:24.480
I thought you seemed
 suspicious...!

14:22.480 --> 14:24.480
(We have to fight her?!)

14:25.400 --> 14:27.010
<i>And that's me.</i>

14:28.570 --> 14:30.360
<i>At age fifteen,</i>

14:30.360 --> 14:34.020
<i>I'm on my way to enter the 
Royal Academy in the capital.</i>

14:34.530 --> 14:39.230
<b>The Hidden Boss Enters the Academy</b>

14:40.510 --> 14:45.540
<i>I was five years old when I regained 
my memories from my previous life.</i>

14:46.730 --> 14:50.570
<i>While I was attending college, 
I got hit by a truck</i>

14:50.570 --> 14:52.810
<i>and reincarnated in this world.</i>

14:55.300 --> 14:58.090
<i>Some research confirmed 
that this was, in fact,</i>

14:58.090 --> 15:02.460
<i>the world of </i>Light and 
Hero<i>, the game I played.</i>

15:03.670 --> 15:06.250
<i>Pondering why it happened won't do any good.</i>

15:06.250 --> 15:09.420
<i>All I know is that that's what happened.</i>

15:10.210 --> 15:15.200
<i>This kingdom was founded by the hero 
and saint who defeated the Demon Lord.</i>

15:15.200 --> 15:17.720
<i>Because that Demon Lord was black-haired,</i>

15:17.720 --> 15:21.920
<i>black hair is seen as unlucky, 
and even as a symbol of evil.</i>

15:25.250 --> 15:29.370
<i>That must be one of the things that 
makes the villainess what she is.</i>

15:29.930 --> 15:32.170
<i>Even my servants keep me at arm's length.</i>

15:33.410 --> 15:38.180
<i>Also, I have no memory of ever meeting 
my parents, who live in the capital.</i>

15:39.260 --> 15:42.330
<i>The Demon Lord can be 
defeated at level 70 or so,</i>

15:42.330 --> 15:44.310
<i>but once Yumiella becomes the hidden boss,</i>

15:44.310 --> 15:46.710
<i>one's level has to be 
maxed out to defeat her.</i>

15:47.260 --> 15:49.160
<i>She is truly the embodiment of unfairness.</i>

15:50.220 --> 15:52.320
<i>But she still gets defeated in the end.</i>

15:52.760 --> 15:56.580
<i>So does my existence really have any meaning?</i>

15:58.420 --> 16:00.820
<i>Still, I thought...</i>

16:01.300 --> 16:03.780
<i>I have the potential to 
surpass even the final boss,</i>

16:03.780 --> 16:06.500
<i>I'm stronger than anyone 
in the heroine's party,</i>

16:06.500 --> 16:10.740
<i>and I can use dark magic, which 
only enemy characters can use.</i>

16:11.220 --> 16:13.700
<i>Isn't that... actually awesome?!</i>

16:15.440 --> 16:19.550
<i>Of course! There's no need to recreate the 
story of </i>Light and Hero<i> to the letter!</i>

16:16.470 --> 16:18.930
William

16:16.470 --> 16:18.930
Stop picking on Alicia. Don't make me angry.

16:19.470 --> 16:21.980
Oswald

16:19.470 --> 16:21.980
If that's how it must be, I have an idea.

16:19.870 --> 16:23.040
<i>I had no interest in the dating 
sim aspect of the game.</i>

16:22.480 --> 16:24.460
Edwin

16:22.480 --> 16:24.460
Stop messing with Alicia!

16:23.730 --> 16:27.340
<i>I had no emotional attachment to the 
three conquerable characters, either.</i>

16:29.050 --> 16:32.300
<i>So instead of living out the 
story of </i>Light and Hero<i>,</i>

16:32.630 --> 16:36.300
<i>I could just lay low and 
enjoy a peaceful school life.</i>

16:36.890 --> 16:40.460
<i>I'd have nothing to do with 
Alicia or the male leads.</i>

16:40.810 --> 16:45.310
<i>That way, I could avoid all risk 
of becoming the hidden boss,</i>

16:45.320 --> 16:53.260
Edwin

16:45.320 --> 16:53.260
Defeat the Demon Lord! Let's go, everyone!

16:45.610 --> 16:47.250
<i>and in the spring of our third year,</i>

16:47.250 --> 16:50.770
<i>Alicia and the boys would defeat 
the resurrected Demon Lord,</i>

16:50.770 --> 16:52.350
<i>and we'd all live happily ever after.</i>

16:57.630 --> 17:00.810
<i>But I should still raise 
my level as much as I can.</i>

17:01.210 --> 17:04.840
<i>I need to be strong enough to beat the 
Demon Lord myself if it comes to that.</i>

17:09.830 --> 17:10.630
Yah.

17:13.390 --> 17:15.130
It comes so naturally.

17:17.220 --> 17:20.260
<i>When you kill a monster, 
you get a magic stone.</i>

17:21.010 --> 17:22.920
<i>I should be able to sell these for money.</i>

17:28.130 --> 17:31.110
I think my movements are a little faster now.

17:31.480 --> 17:33.920
Is this what leveling up feels like?

17:36.530 --> 17:38.650
<i>The gamer blood in me is boiling!</i>

17:40.570 --> 17:43.360
<i>I was always the type to get 
absorbed in what I was doing,</i>

17:43.360 --> 17:45.850
<i>so I'd sneak out of the 
mansion essentially every day</i>

17:46.290 --> 17:48.410
<i>and get engrossed in leveling up.</i>

17:49.290 --> 17:52.250
<i>On top of that, I made 
money off of magic stones</i>

17:52.250 --> 17:53.800
<i>and bought all kinds of items.</i>

17:54.460 --> 17:57.450
<i>The first thing I bought 
was the Amulet of Growth.</i>

17:57.450 --> 18:00.740
<i>The Amulet of Protection would 
be better for keeping me safe,</i>

18:00.740 --> 18:04.950
<i>but wearing this would allow 
me to level up much faster.</i>

18:06.540 --> 18:09.210
<i>Then, I entered the dungeon.</i>

18:10.510 --> 18:12.190
<i>I'll be fine by myself.</i>

18:12.650 --> 18:15.730
<i>I can regenerate an arm 
with my magic if I need to.</i>

18:18.780 --> 18:19.830
<i>I conquered it.</i>

18:25.020 --> 18:28.130
<i>I also acquired the Monster-Calling Flute.</i>

18:31.460 --> 18:32.210
<i>And day...</i>

18:34.590 --> 18:35.340
<i>after day...</i>

18:37.720 --> 18:38.470
<i>after day...</i>

18:45.140 --> 18:47.040
<i>Until today, at age fifteen,</i>

18:47.040 --> 18:50.510
<i>I've focused only on leveling up efficiently.</i>

18:50.510 --> 18:53.980
<i>I've been through the same dungeon 
from start to end countless times.</i>

18:59.290 --> 19:02.970
<i>I hope I'll be able to continue 
leveling up after I start school.</i>

19:14.690 --> 19:17.110
Even the building looks just 
like it did in the game.

19:22.970 --> 19:24.860
I'm exhausted.

19:27.880 --> 19:29.740
<i>Attend the Royal Academy.</i>

19:30.230 --> 19:34.430
<i>While there, befriend as many sons 
of high-ranking noblemen as you can.</i>

19:35.010 --> 19:39.270
<i>They don't need to be eldest sons, as I'll 
have one marry you and become my heir.</i>

19:41.350 --> 19:44.440
And this is my first 
interaction with my parents?

19:45.970 --> 19:47.040
I should...

19:47.040 --> 19:48.910
It's time to lock the gate.

19:48.910 --> 19:53.030
It's the rule that the Royal 
Academy's main gate closes at 6 o'clock.

19:53.030 --> 19:56.480
But the bell hasn't even finished ringing...

19:58.270 --> 20:01.550
<i>It's really playing out just 
like it did in </i>Light and Hero<i>.</i>

20:02.480 --> 20:05.550
Wait, the color of your necktie... 
Aren't you a first-year, too?

20:06.220 --> 20:08.690
<i>Avoid getting involved with those four.</i>

20:09.070 --> 20:11.610
<i>That's the key to having a peaceful life.</i>

20:15.990 --> 20:17.980
The new students will now enter.

20:18.840 --> 20:22.570
The Royal Academy Entrance 
Ceremony will now commence.

20:23.340 --> 20:27.330
Having the privilege to welcome you 
first-years to our school today

20:27.330 --> 20:31.080
gives all of us at the academy 
the greatest pleasure.

20:31.080 --> 20:33.060
As you are already aware...

20:31.880 --> 20:34.080
<i>I feel eyes on me.</i>

20:34.710 --> 20:37.900
<i>Oh, right. It must be my hair.</i>

20:38.590 --> 20:41.880
We will now assess your levels.

20:42.170 --> 20:44.250
<i>What? Assess our levels?</i>

20:48.640 --> 20:51.300
Alicia Ehnleit: level 1.

20:51.900 --> 20:53.930
Work your hardest going forward.

20:53.930 --> 20:55.140
I will.

20:55.510 --> 20:57.580
<i>What is my level, anyway?</i>

20:57.580 --> 21:00.310
<i>Come to think of it, I've never checked...</i>

21:00.310 --> 21:02.570
William Ares: level 10.

21:02.570 --> 21:03.590
Whoa!

21:03.590 --> 21:04.780
Incredible!

21:05.000 --> 21:06.250
Yeah, I guess!

21:06.770 --> 21:09.030
<i>They're that excited over level 10?</i>

21:09.030 --> 21:13.540
<i>Then if I don't want to stand out, 
I hope I'm... around level 5?</i>

21:15.160 --> 21:16.540
<i>Level 5...</i>

21:17.280 --> 21:20.130
<i>wouldn't be enough to beat a boss character.</i>

21:21.320 --> 21:22.950
Miss Yumiella Dolkness.

21:23.530 --> 21:24.170
Yes, sir.

21:26.810 --> 21:28.550
Are you nervous?

21:28.850 --> 21:33.310
Don't worry. There's nothing embarrassing 
about being level 1 when you start school.

21:33.770 --> 21:35.930
<i>No, that's not why I'm nervous.</i>

21:45.900 --> 21:49.490
Eldest daughter of Count 
Dolkness, Yumiella Dolkness...

21:49.490 --> 21:51.920
L-Level 99?!

21:51.920 --> 21:53.330
What?!

21:53.330 --> 21:54.500
For real?!

21:54.500 --> 21:56.560
Level 99?!

22:03.410 --> 22:09.140
<i>Well... goodbye to my peaceful life...</i>

22:34.350 --> 22:37.920
<b>Villainess Level 99</b>

22:34.620 --> 22:37.920
I May Be the Hidden Boss but I'm Not the Demon Lord
